title Storm Tracker — make your own interactive storm dashboard with live feeds
description A simple, open-source storm dashboard. Explore live examples for Nolo, Odalys, and Polo, then get the source to track a storm of your own.
baseUrl https://knowbooks.com/s/stormTracker/
permalink index.html
htmlLang en
buildHtml
openGraphImage lowell.jpg
favicon favicon.svg
metaTags

<header><a class="brand" href="index.html"><span aria-hidden="true">◉</span> Storm Tracker</a><a class="header-link" href="https://github.com/breck7/knowbooks.com/tree/main/s/stormTracker">GitHub ↗</a></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro">

# Keep an eye on the storm.
 id intro

Live cameras, satellite imagery, and forecasts in one place.
 class intro

</section>
<section class="examples" aria-labelledby="examples-title">

## Choose a storm
 id examples-title

// Newest storms first; prepend new storm cards here.
<div class="example-grid">
a
 href hawaii.nolo.html
 addClass example
 aria-label Open the Nolo tracker for Hawaiʻi
 div
  addClass example-caption
  div
   h3 Nolo
   Hawaiʻi · All main islands
  span Open tracker ↗
   addClass open-example

a
 href hawaii.odalys.html
 addClass example
 aria-label Open the Odalys tracker for Hawaiʻi
 div
  addClass example-caption
  div
   h3 Odalys
   Hawaiʻi · All main islands
  span Open tracker ↗
   addClass open-example

a
 href hawaii.polo.html
 addClass example
 aria-label Open the Polo tracker for Hawaiʻi
 div
  addClass example-caption
  div
   h3 Polo
   Hawaiʻi · All main islands
  span Open tracker ↗
   addClass open-example

</div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>

Built with Scroll. Copy a storm file to make your own.
 https://scroll.surf Scroll

</footer>

css
 :root{color-scheme:dark;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#eaf7ff;background:#071016;font-synthesis:none}
 *{box-sizing:border-box}
 body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0,rgba(35,105,129,.16),transparent 60%);min-height:100vh}
 a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
 header{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:20px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
 .brand{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:750}
 .brand span{color:#61dffa;font-size:23px}
 .header-link{font-size:13px;color:#a3becb;padding:8px 0}
 main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px}
 .hero{margin:20px 0 28px}
 h1{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:750}
 .intro{margin:0;color:#abc3cf;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}
 .examples h2{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;color:#93afbd;margin:0 0 12px}
 .example-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
 .example{display:block;position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #25404c;border-radius:10px;background:#0c1921;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
 .example:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:url("lowell.jpg") center 48%/cover no-repeat;filter:grayscale(1);mix-blend-mode:luminosity;opacity:.16;pointer-events:none}
 .example:hover{border-color:#68e1f8;background:#102530}
 .example-caption{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px;padding:22px}
 .example h3{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 7px}
 .example p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#93afbd;margin:0}
 .open-example{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#68e1f8;white-space:nowrap}
 footer{max-width:1200px;margin:24px auto 0;padding:0 28px 24px;color:#7895a4;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}
 footer p{margin:0}footer a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
 a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9cedff;outline-offset:4px}
 @media(max-width:650px){header{padding:12px 18px}main{padding:0 18px}.hero{margin:14px 0 22px}.intro{font-size:14px}.example-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.example-caption{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:16px}.example h3{font-size:21px;margin-bottom:4px}.open-example{font-size:12px}footer{margin-top:18px;padding:0 18px 18px}}
 @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important}}
